<Base title="How we test" description="How Retested tests AI prompts across ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, and Muse: same inputs, recorded model versions and dates, a fixed rubric, and re-tests when models change." crumbs={[['How we test', '/methodology/']]}>
<div class="wrap prose">
  <div class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Retested</div><h1>How we test</h1></div>
  <ol><li>Each prompt runs on ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, and Muse with the same inputs.</li><li>We record the exact model version and date, and keep the raw output.</li><li>Each output is scored against a fixed rubric for the use case: pass, partial, or fail.</li><li>When a model updates, affected prompts are re-tested and the badge changes.</li><li>Gemini, Microsoft Copilot, Perplexity, Meta AI, DeepSeek, and Mistral Le Chat get a generic prompt with adaptation notes unless a tailored one is written.</li></ol>
  <p>Reviewer: to be named.</p>
</div>
</Base>
